{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"\"Master... Where is your homeland? If ya aint mindin me askin?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:03:14.668000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867436570788233227","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"Malathor sits down across from you slowly, placing his scepter topped with a crystal orb between the two of them. \"Mmm, yes, I will tell you of my homeland... Transylvania, a historical region rich in magic and *mystery*, located in central Romania. Bound on the east and south by its natural borders, the Carpathian mountain range, extending westward to the Apuseni Mountains...\" Malathor says in a reminiscent tone.","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:08:03.786000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867437783438196786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"Bo listens intently","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:08:57.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867438007728078868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"I met the love of my life there, you see, a conflict raged in my youth, and I joined it, there I met a man, who would soon be like a brother to me... He married a woman, who's sister, I found to be rather...\" Malathor stares through Bo for a moment, as though reliving a memory. \"*Wonderful.*\" Malathor says this with a small smile.","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:12:10.237000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T16:12:49.339000Z","id":"867438817128611880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"Bo smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:14:18.190000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867439353801867265","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"\"But enough tales of my youth, tell me my apprentice, where do you hail from originally, did you have friends there you left behind, *family, perhaps?*\" Malathor asks leaning in.","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:15:18.146000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867439605274771497","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"Bo looks ahead quietly. \"I-... He trails off. After clearing his throat. \"I left momma behind with my 72 brothers and sister back home... Pops got taken by the wolves back home, tis why i joined the border Patrol. I left in search of more to the story we heard about a sandshark defending a town from the firebirds.\" He chuckles. \"Damn coats took my coin that led me on this journey.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:18:17.473000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867440357427642370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"Malathor nods solemnly. \"It is... Unfortunate, when the ones we love are taken from us, sometimes, far... Far too soon...\" Malathor says in a tone that betrays a sense of loss. \"But that is why you decided accept me as your mentor is it not, to prevent such *loss*?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:20:26.222000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867440897440350249","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"Bo nods","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:20:47.373000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867440986153025559","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"\"Yeah... Hadnt thought i'd desire much... But seeing another friend fall, knowing the price to bring one back... I'm inclined to find a way to stop death. If not for me.... Then for all my friends.\" He looks towards Malathor. \"Even you if that time would come and I'm able.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:24:20.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867441881080528896","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"\"Personal life, expression, knowledge, and history advance obliquely, and not directly, toward ends or toward concepts. That which is sought too deliberately is not obtained... You must be clever, use *guile* and *cunning* to protect that which you love...\" Malathor continues as he closes his eyes, his face greatly obscured in the shadow of his hood.","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:24:50.429000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867442005604565043","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"Bo nods","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:28:06.461000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867442827821973544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"866747835147223080","content":"\"However sometimes...\" Malathor begins to stand, reaching into his robes beneath his cloak and producing, a single bright, shiny, red apple. He begins to walk several steps away, bending down and setting it roughly 15 feet away from Bo, the great pale face looming behind him. Malathor returns and looks to Bo as he raises both of his hands, his twisted wrinkled digits becoming visible as his fingertips begin to glow. \"*sometimes trickery and illusion is not enough, sometimes you must have* **Power**.\" Malathor shouts as blue bolts if Lightning spring forth from his outstretched hands, connecting with the Apple and instantly roasting it. \"*DO YOU DESIRE POWER BO?*\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:33:09.800000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867444100118216714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
